------------------
- Ubuntu 16.04 64-bit


Features:
---------
- Added support for new machine:
  * phyboard-polis-imx8mm-1
- Booting from EMMC and SD-Card is supported
- Added new features:
   * EEPROM support (kernel)
   * USB host support 2.0 (kernel)
   * USB OTG support 2.0 (kernel)
